OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fshowers will continue through the
OL,7,Fevening, these heavy and thundery in
OL,8,Fplaces. These showers will slowly ease
OL,9,Fovernight but the odd one will linger
OL,10,Funtil dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FBright spells and scattered
OL,13,Fshowers, perhaps heavy in places, then
OL,14,Fbecoming dry through the afternoon.
OL,15,FWarm near the East Coast.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FA
OL,18,Funsettled period with sunny spells and
OL,19,Ffurther showers, heavy at times. A
OL,20,Fspell of wet and windy weather on
OL,21,FWednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
